{"id":"5602","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5602_main_polar-stratospheric-clouds-nacreous_special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图中的珠母云是飞机在挪威北部上空爬升至近9000米（30000英尺）高空时看到的。</p>\n<p>这些极地平流层云主要由冰构成，其特点是耀眼的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">虹彩色</span>及<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状</span>。</p>\n<p>珠母云在平流层以及在南北半球各自冬季高纬度地区才会形成。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Marco Quaranta","location":"挪威北部","latitude":"纬度: 68° 46' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 19° 20' 24'' E","date":"07 January 2017 1421 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.1"}]}]}